From 0d293ac19cd3b2c52d1476a6eec5fda14a457ce3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 18:36:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] temp/libcamera: add contrast detection autofocus for the
 software ISP

Add a sharpness measure to the software ISP statistics, pass the focus lens
controls between the simple pipeline handler and the soft IPA, and add a
contrast detection autofocus algorithm. Enable it for the OnePlus 8 Pro
telephoto camera (S5K3M5).

Signed-off-by: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
---
